Björk is no stranger when it comes to bringing dark and mysterious worlds into the limelight. With recent performances in Iceland at the world famous Harpa concert hall and her appearance at Glastonbury Festival in the Summer – with a new album on its way – she had the first ever preview of a new album, a short teaser video shot by her sister Halla Ósk and Hans Hansen on location during one of their creative shooting sessions this past year on location in Iceland.
